--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

SmatEconData retrieves observations from third-party providers including FRED
(Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis), the World Bank, the International Monetary
Fund, Eurostat, the OECD, the Bank for International Settlements, UN Comtrade,
Statistics Canada, ExchangeRate-API and CoinGecko.

Those observations remain subject to each provider's own terms of use and
copyright. Provider metadata bundled with this repository retains the copyright
notices supplied by the provider. SmatEconData claims no ownership of any
third-party data and generates a citation for every exported column.
